<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovakia May construction output rises 3.8 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Slovakia May construction output rises 3.8 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak real industrial output in May was 3.8 percent higher, year-on-year, slowing from 10.8 percent real growth in April, the Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>  CONSTRUCTION OUTPUT    May 97    April 97	May 96</p>
<p>  pct change yr/yr	 +3.8	 +10.8	   +2.5</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
